Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《007系列之黎明生机》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 对于国防部来说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,this may only be an exercise...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...这不过是个练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so far as the Ministry of Defense is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但对我来说00部队 被挑选作试验...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for me, it is a matter of pride...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.38,0:01:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...实在是光荣的事 这次行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the 00-section has been chosen for this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们负责渗入 直布罗陀的雷达装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your objective is to penetrate the radar installations of Gibraltar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特种航空队已经高度戒备要拦截\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The SAS have been placed on full alert to intercept you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道你们不会让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know you won't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 老友 你出局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, chum. You're out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game's up, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓牢一点 不然你死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on,you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好闷 玛戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all so boring here, Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里只有一些花花公子和网球手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing but playboys and tennis pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我可以找到真正的男子汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only I could find a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用你的电话 她会再打电话给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to use your phone. She'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁?  - 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制中心 我是007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exercise Control, 007 here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小时后我再报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll report in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加入我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't you join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个小时好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better make that two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百提斯拉瓦 捷克斯拉夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}BRATISLAVA, CZECHOSLOVAKIA
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是桑德斯 维也纳第五队队长 你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saunders, head of Section V,Vienna. You're bloodv late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来执行任务 不是参加舞会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a mission, not a fancy dress ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要保护的人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's our man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在包厢里 在KGB保镖的中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the box, between the KGB minders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的女大提琴手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely girl with the cello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时别看女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget the ladies for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科斯克夫在中厂会离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koskov will leave the concert at the interval.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最好离开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把灯关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们先互相沟通一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's understand one another, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科斯克夫上将是KGB的主脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Koskov is a top KGB mastermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他联络我的 他变节是我的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His defection is my baby. He contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个细节都是我策划的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've planned this out to the last detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你会用软头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll want the soft-nosed ones, I expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我用钢头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,the steel-tipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:49.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,KGB狙击手通常会穿防弹衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KGB snipers usually wear body armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的逃亡路线是怎么样的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your escape route?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二十六章第五段说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Section 26, paragraph 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在必要情况下才会说出资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That information is on a need-to-know basis only.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信你会明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科斯克夫受到KGB的严密监管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koskov is under intensive KGB surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有狙击手要杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sniper has been assigned to watch him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他指定要你保护他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he expressly asked for you to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他认为你是最好的特务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's under the impression you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在后面的巷子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the allev, out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿椅子来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要用十秒时间来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll take him about 10 seconds to reach us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足够让狙击手取他的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plentv of time for a sniper to make strawberry jam of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是科斯克夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Koskov.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙击手 楼上两层   中间的窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sniper. Two floors up. Center window.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉大提琴的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl with the cello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪吧! 邦德!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire, Bond! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向她开火吧! 还等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot her! what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你故意打不中她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed. Deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在哪里?  - 在行李箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - In the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们首先会找那里 - 我的逃生路线!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- First place they'd look. - My escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scrubbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.61,0:16:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到前面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James. James Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.95,0:16:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚点再说 上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆脱他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在边境接你 二十三点 别迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pick you up at the border, 23:00 hours. Be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要带他到哪里去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you taking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.96,0:16:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 第二十六章第五段说明 不能随便透露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, old man. Section 26, paragraph 5, need-to-know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你也明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 狙击手是个女的 - 我注意到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The sniper was a woman. - I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,KGB的神射手也有女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the best KGB shots are women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有没有… - 我不想谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you... - I'd rather not talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若他们封锁边境 我怎么出去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they close the border, how will I get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基奥治 别担心 我们有通往西方的输油管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you worrv about that, Georgi. we have a pipeline to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(跨西伯利亚输油管)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是罗西卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosika Miklos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our man here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好高兴再度跟你合作 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to work with you again, Mr. Bond. Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点 把他放进小猪里 - 什么小猪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We must hurry. Get him in the pig. - Pig? what is pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清洗输油管的塞子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scouring plug to clean out the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是为了运送人而设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's been designed to carrv a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输油管? 你是说我们的输油管吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pipeline? You mean our pipeline?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏维埃的伟大发明 运送天然气到西欧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Soviet achievement. Piping natural gas into western Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是运送我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 不过是小意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worrv. It's a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.19,0:17:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你在一百度以前开动栓塞 他就会变成罗宋汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you open valye before 100, he will be borscht.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猪 罗宋汤 一定有别的方法吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pigs, borscht, cake. There must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上面具 正常的呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on the mask and breathe normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别再说了 - 基奥治 放松一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enough talk. - Relax, Georgi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的工程师花了几个月 研究这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our engineers spent months perfecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这东西你们用过多少次?  - 这是第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many times have you done this? - You're the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住 到了一百度 开动这个 别提早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember,when this says 100, turn this. Not before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你上哪里去?  - 去收拾这里的主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - To take care of the supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小猪弹出去的时候 他的控制台会好像圣诞树般闪亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When pig goes, his control panel will light up like Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:34.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我是什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''What kind of girl do you think I am?''
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上将 欢迎来到奥地利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Austria, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧! 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Hurry up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们接到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.58,0:20:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你 关上它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开心点 桑德斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheer up, Saunders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务成功了 都归功于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The operation's a success and officially still yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:58.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会这样就算了 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no intention of leaving it at that, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉M你故意打不中她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling M that you deliberately missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的任务是杀掉狙击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your orders were to kill that sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.43,0:22:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别瞎说 我只杀专业的杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stuff my orders. I only kill professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩连枪头跟枪尾也分不清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl didn't know one end of a rifle from the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.63,0:22:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要告诉M 随便你 若他开除我 我会谢谢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell M what you want. If he fires me, I'll thank him for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管她是谁 我已经把她吓个半死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever she was, I must've scared the living davlights out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄罗斯上将投诚了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Russian general defects!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄国名将投诚了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Famous Russian general defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤李亚考夫 三人确定已经死亡 两人可能已经死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ula Yokhfov. Confirmed kills: three. Probable kills: two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.79,0:22:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行刺方式 用手或以大腿扼死敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assassination methods: strangulation with hands or thighs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.76,0:22:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 她正是你喜欢的类型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why,James, she's just your tvpe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了 钱班霓 你才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong again, Monevpennv. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把这个跟其他秘密资料 一起存档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll file that with the other secret information here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专长是扮成小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Specialist: child impersonations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.27,0:22:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行刺方式是用藏有炸弹的玩具熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assassination method: explosive teddv bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是所有KGB女杀手的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,that's all the KGB female assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.07,0:22:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以试用 驻守苏维埃外的雇佣兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,we could trv freelancers stationed outside the Soviet bloc.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:23:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间不够 M在布莱登安全房等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll have to wait. M wants you out at the Blavden safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.62,0:23:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正留在这儿也没意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like it's a dead end here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.49,0:23:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.57,0:23:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为美国人研制了一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something we're making for the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫做贫民区轰击炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called a ghetto blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.11,0:23:29.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,M想你中途在哈罗德斯百货公司 拿点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M wants you to stop at Harrods on your way and pick up a parcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱班霓 帮我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monevpennv, be a dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫记录部去察看捷克的出版商 或新问部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask Records to monitor Czech publication and news services...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.42,0:23:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉迪斯拉发的公立音乐学院 有没有女大提琴手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for any mention of a woman cellist at the conservatoire in Bratislava.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.49,0:23:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你也喜欢音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know you were such a music lover,James.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候来我家听一听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any time you want to drop by and listen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.73,0:23:52.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的巴里曼尼洛系列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my Barry Manilow collection....
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 借一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, sir. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.94,0:24:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死北方佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloodv Yanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.11,0:24:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制中心 007正在途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control here. 007's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:53.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.63,0:24:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 邦德先生 请把枪留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Mr. Bond. You'll have to leave the metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.13,0:25:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.80,0:25:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早 有什么可以效劳?  - 不 我自己去就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning. May I help you? - No,thanks. I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在客厅等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're expecting you in the drawing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.91,0:25:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.18,0:25:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.12,0:25:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会记得你为我所做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, I will never forget what you did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.55,0:25:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢…这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you so... what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.96,0:25:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自哈罗德斯的好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Harrods. A godsend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里的食物很糟 - 鹅肝酱却不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The food here is horrible. - The foie gras is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.63,0:25:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄罗斯人有个说法 讲心讲胃 才是好同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Russians say, hearts and stomachs good comrades make.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.90,0:25:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是鱼子酱?  这是我们农家的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this? Caviar? That's peasant food for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.84,0:25:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但给香槟下酒也不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with champagne, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.17,0:25:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勃林加酒是最好的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bollinger R.D. The best!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单子上的牌子不够好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brand on the list was questionable...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.85,0:25:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我另选别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so I chose something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.68,0:25:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superb, Mr. Bond! Superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.75,0:25:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们继续简报好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I suggest we resume the debriefing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:26:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 继续吧 我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. Go ahead. I'm all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.66,0:26:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 平时那个送牛奶的人呢?  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the usual milkman? - What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时那个送牛奶的人呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the usual man?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.94,0:26:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, mate,watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厨房入口在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitchen entrance. Round the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.51,0:26:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为了利昂尼普谢金上将 才变节的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Leonid Pushkin is why I defect!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.08,0:26:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的KGB上级?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your KGB superior?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.49,0:26:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当高戈去外国执行任务时的代里人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gogol's replacement when he went to their foreign service.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.66,0:26:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾经是好兄弟 现在他整个人都变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we were like brothers, but now he's a different man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.83,0:26:42.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被权力冲昏了头脑 好像斯达林一样疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power has gone to his head. He's sick, like Stalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不喜欢我们的新政策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hates our new policv of detente.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.90,0:26:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.97,0:26:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金的秘密命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...secret directive from Pushkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.54,0:26:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诛杀特务行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smiert Spionom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.81,0:27:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是杀死间谍 部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Death to spies,'' minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.65,0:27:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个行刺计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For an assassination program with list of targets...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.65,0:27:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标是英美的特务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...British and American agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.62,0:27:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划开始了   就会展开连厂仇杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this starts,you will retaliate. Murder will follow murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.32,0:27:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏维埃和西方的情报机关 会互相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soviet and western intelligence could destrov each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.69,0:27:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 这会引起核战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God forbid,this might lead to nuclear war!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.63,0:27:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless Pushkin can be....
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.06,0:27:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.17,0:27:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把普谢金杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.97,0:27:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在在哪里? 莫斯科?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Pushkin now? In Moscow?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.91,0:27:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 但三天之内他会到丹吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da, but in three davs, he will leave for Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:35.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表面原因是参加北非贸易会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover: North African Trade Convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.15,0:27:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正原因是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.55,0:27:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,执行新任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.79,0:27:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长 根据科斯克夫先生刚才说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minister, in view of the importance of what Mr. Koskov has just told us...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.73,0:27:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该休会 到伦敦联络高层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we should adjourn to London and consult with higher authoritv.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.90,0:27:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然 科斯克夫先生再见 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- By all means. Good dav, Mr. Koskov. - Good dav, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.27,0:28:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你吃 乖乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. There's a good lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.65,0:28:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你早 - 请放在这里好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning. - Put it down there,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.06,0:28:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.74,0:28:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队呼叫基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4 to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.15,0:28:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4, Green 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.65,0:28:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是保安控制中心 你在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Security Control. Whereare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.92,0:28:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队 这是控制中心 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4, this is Security. Comein,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队 你听见吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队呼叫基地 主大楼泄漏了危险气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4 to base. we have dangerous gas leaks in main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.46,0:29:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上撤离 找紧急医疗队求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuateimmediately. Sendfor emergency medical services.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.96,0:29:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队 收到你的讯息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4, l readand understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.10,0:29:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制中心通知各单位 开始实施十号紧急措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Controltoall stations. Code 10. lnitiate emergency drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.17,0:29:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上撤离主大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.97,0:29:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急状态…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency. Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.27,0:29:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各单位马上撤离主大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel evacuate the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.85,0:29:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绿四队呼叫基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Green 4 to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.98,0:29:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了气体爆炸 别走近主大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had a gas explosion. Keep clear of the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.85,0:30:02.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是KGB\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KGB!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家往后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep back, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.97,0:30:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 不要杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up. - Don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.10,0:30:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 不要杀我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.21,0:30:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.18,0:30:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.25,0:30:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要走近主大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep clear of the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 用来载谁?  - 你 同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's that for? - You, comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮他 否则我杀了你们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him or I kill you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.07,0:30:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.91,0:31:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两人死亡 两人受伤送院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two dead,two in a hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若科斯克夫还没有死的话 他该回到莫斯科了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Koskov probably back in Moscow, if not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.86,0:31:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成了整个特务界的笑柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the laughingstock of the intelligence communitv.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.96,0:31:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们多年来最严重的打击 被KGB成功的在他变节后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our first major coup in vears snatched from right under our noses...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几小时之内又将他劫回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...by the KGB only hours after he defected.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.53,0:32:00.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 找不到他?  - 找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No trace of him? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.80,0:32:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有普谢金的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then there's this Pushkin matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.54,0:32:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I must be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.04,0:32:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午跟首相开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meeting with the PM this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.41,0:32:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得制止诛杀特杀行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to nip Smiert Spionom in the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.02,0:32:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金两天之内该到达丹吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pushkin should be in Tangier in two davs' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.29,0:32:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人下了暗杀令要杀掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A termination warrant has been issued for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.82,0:32:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个诛杀特务的命令似乎太牵强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This plot to kill agents sounds rather far-fetched, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.49,0:32:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我认识普谢金上将 - 难道我不认识他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know General Pushkin. - And you think I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.16,0:32:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟他交过几次手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've dealt with him on several occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.16,0:32:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往后几年我们都有碰头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our paths have crossed over the vears.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.37,0:32:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这人强硬又足智多谋 不像是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tough and resourceful, but I can't believe he's a psvchotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.31,0:32:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不相信 但现在不得不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither did I, until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.11,0:32:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西由直布罗陀送来 在004身旁发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This arrived from Gibraltar. It was found near 004's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.85,0:32:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诛杀特务行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name was on Pushkin's list too, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几件事情我得先弄清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a few things I'd like to check out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.39,0:33:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说 那个狙击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sniper,for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我也看过桑德斯的报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I've read Saunders' report.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.36,0:33:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为了不射杀那漂亮的女孩 而危及整个任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You jeopardized the entire mission to avoid shooting a beautiful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.53,0:33:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 我作了一个即时的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly, sir. I had to make a split-second decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.00,0:33:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是出于本能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.04,0:33:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会从香港召回008 由他接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll recall 008 from Hong Kong. He can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.64,0:33:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他根本不认识普谢金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know Pushkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.44,0:33:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他服从命令 而不是按本能行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He follows orders, not instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.98,0:33:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可以放两星期假 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can take a fortnight's leave. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.25,0:33:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.52,0:33:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一定要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it has to be done...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.22,0:33:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd rather do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.36,0:33:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢放下来 轻一点 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it down slowly. Gently, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Q 你早 - 007 你早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morning, Q. - Morning, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:42.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心你的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.57,0:33:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.34,0:33:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是刚研制的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just winterizing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,007 留心听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, pay attention, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.11,0:33:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是万能钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kev-ring finder.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.51,0:33:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲解一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.25,0:34:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按这个按钮就变武器 就这样子 见到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You arm it by pressing that button there. Like that, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.12,0:34:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 戴上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Now wear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.72,0:34:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 吹出《大不列颠万岁》第一节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Now,whistle the first bars of ''Rule Britannia.''
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.71,0:34:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷晕气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stun gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.24,0:34:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有效范围只有五尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Effective range: oh, about five feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.68,0:34:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷昏一个正常人 只需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disorientates any normal person for about...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.68,0:34:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.05,0:34:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这行业里没几个正常人的 Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't find too many normal people in this business, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.99,0:34:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么炸毁那房间?  吹"天佑女王"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I blow up the room? whistle ''God save the Queen''?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.02,0:34:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在万能钥匙里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've packed the finder...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.96,0:34:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,装设了高浓度的塑胶炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a highly concentrated plastic explosive...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.03,0:34:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足以炸开任何保险箱的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...sufficient to remove the door of any safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.56,0:34:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由磁力控制 可以自订个人启动讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's magnetic. The actuating signal is personalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.07,0:34:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的讯号是什么?  - 是最适合你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's my code? - Oh, most appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.74,0:34:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 狼叫声 - 你是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A wolf whistle. - You mean....
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.71,0:34:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.04,0:35:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些钥匙对你很有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mav find the kevs useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.48,0:35:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可开启世界上百分之九十的锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They open 90% of the world's locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.55,0:35:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 请坐 好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Sit down and make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.33,0:35:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得好 钱班霓 就是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done. That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记录部刚送来这份翻译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Records just sent over this translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.53,0:35:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉米劳维 出色的大提琴手 曾获奖学金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Kara Milovy,talented scholarship cellist...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.43,0:35:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上星期演奏会休息时 手臂意外受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whose arm was injured in an accident during intermission last week...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.17,0:35:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星期四将会回到学院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will be back at the academy on Thursdav...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.50,0:35:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演奏波洛丁的《弦乐四重奏D调第二号乐曲》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}playing Borodin's "String Quartet No. 2 in D".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.44,0:35:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是明天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.41,0:35:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱班霓 请预备经过布拉迪斯拉发 到丹吉尔的旅游证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monevpennv, I'll need travel documents for Tangier via Bratislava.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.05,0:35:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And keep this between ourselyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.72,0:35:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定很出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl must be very talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.45,0:35:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我 我只因为工作关系才对她有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, my interest in her is purely professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.39,0:35:54.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要开阿士顿马丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just taking the Aston Martin out for a quick spin, Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 007 我刚喷上油漆呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful, 007. It's just had a new coat of paint!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.76,0:39:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(卡拉米劳维 布拉迪斯拉发)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.01,0:40:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把枪丢到河里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dropped the gun in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.35,0:40:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,KGB把这里弄得一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KGB made quite a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.46,0:40:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是英国人 你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're English. who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.03,0:40:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨天在公立音乐学院 听你的演奏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you play at the conservatoire vesterdav.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.53,0:40:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.50,0:40:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见在电车发生的事 他们带你到哪里去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw what happened on the tram. where did they take you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.78,0:40:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,KGB总部?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KGB headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.55,0:40:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们今早放我走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They released me this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.68,0:40:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看对街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.75,0:41:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让你走 然后就可以跟踪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They let you go so they could follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白 你干嘛帮我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. why are you trving to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.90,0:41:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金想怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did Pushkin want?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.87,0:41:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有问你 基奥治科斯克夫的情况吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he ask you about Georgi Koskov?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.95,0:41:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想知道他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted to know where he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.05,0:41:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你告诉了他?  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you tell him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.08,0:41:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基奥治真聪明 懂得用空弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was clever of Georgi, using blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.86,0:41:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让英方以为他真的投诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made the British believe his defection was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.42,0:41:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.76,0:41:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟我说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.46,0:41:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你见过他?  - 两天前 他现在很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw him? - Two davs ago. He's safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.94,0:41:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a friend of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.04,0:41:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩一起经历过许多患难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been through quite a lot together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.14,0:41:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基奥治 他果然守信找人来找我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Georgi. He kept his promise to send for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.81,0:42:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里? 伦敦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going? To London?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.95,0:42:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 英方认为 他暂时到别的地方会比较安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not vet. The British think he'll be safer if he moves around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.79,0:42:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也许可以在维也纳和他会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might catch up with him in Vienna.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.89,0:42:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得在他们 再抓到你以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must leave immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.06,0:42:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before they pick you up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.16,0:42:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么走呢?  - 我们自有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But how? - We'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.56,0:42:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收拾行李 带些保温的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get packed. Bring some warm clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.76,0:43:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好像过关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like we got away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.77,0:43:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的大提琴 我留在音乐学院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cello! It's at the conservatoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.54,0:43:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在维也纳给你再买一个 - 不 我们要回去拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get you another in Vienna. - No,we must go back for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.87,0:43:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他们会发现怎么回事之前 我们只有十分种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have about 10 minutes before they discover what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.54,0:43:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我一定要取回我的大提琴 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must get my cello. - No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.30,0:44:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不学小提琴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you learn the violin?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.80,0:44:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你截听了警察频道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked up the police band.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.94,0:44:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是大气电波反常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be an atmospheric anomaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.91,0:44:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在找一辆外国的车 和一对男女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're looking for a foreign car, a man and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.91,0:44:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还带着一个大提琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a cello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.08,0:45:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来给发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like they just found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.20,0:45:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停在一旁吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over to the side and stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.72,0:45:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.16,0:45:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车子受侵蚀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salt corrosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.76,0:45:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们设了路障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're setting up roadblocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.35,0:46:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.75,0:46:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还加装了几个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had a few extras installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.18,0:46:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好神奇 现代的安全玻璃真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing,this modern safetv glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.42,0:46:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.73,0:46:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这条路通往哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See where this leads to.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.77,0:47:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能够通往一个大湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This road only leads to the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.90,0:47:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.92,0:49:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.16,0:49:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(自我毁灭)
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.13,0:49:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来吧 走了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, quick! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.31,0:49:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我坚持要你回去拿大提琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad I insisted you brought that cello.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.15,0:50:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.89,0:50:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not far now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.90,0:50:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了 拿起给他们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. waye this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.07,0:50:28.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躺下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.94,0:50:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们没有东西报关! - 只有一个大提琴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've nothing to declare! - Just the cello!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.05,0:50:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,檀吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TANGIERS
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.62,0:51:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你在这里等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wait here, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.02,0:51:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找主管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll find the chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.94,0:51:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Pushkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.45,0:51:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会 我是布拉德惠特克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pleasure. I'm Brad whitaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.18,0:51:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想过在丹吉尔会见到你 科斯克夫跟你一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't expect to see you in Tangier. General Koskov with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.35,0:51:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争 人类的主要工作就是战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War. War's always been man's main occupation.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.99,0:52:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有傻挂才说最伟大的发明是 文字或是轮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fools say his greatest accomplishments were the wheel or the alphabet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.96,0:52:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说是火药和撞锤才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say it's a battering ram and gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.53,0:52:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢我这忠烈祠吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like my pantheon of great commanders?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.27,0:52:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屠夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.00,0:52:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是外科医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surgeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们割掉社会的腐肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cut away societv's dead flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.17,0:52:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你看些东西 稍息 军士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you something. At ease, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.44,0:52:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.68,0:52:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的爱好是研究 世界历史战争的策略和战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hobby. The strategv and tactics of the world's historic battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.42,0:52:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1985年 阿富汉的西北前线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afghanistan, the Northwest Frontier, 1895.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.12,0:52:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首次试验第一把自动机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The initial trial of the first automatic machine gun:
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.39,0:52:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点303马克沁口径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.303 caliber Maxim.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.46,0:52:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皇家来福枪 曾扫除庞大的精锐部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king's roval rifles. They wiped out a vastly superior force.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.13,0:52:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把英国人多困在阿富汉二十五年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kept the British in Afghanistan for another 25 vears.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.37,0:52:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在俄国人需要的是 现代化的马克沁武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you Russians need nowadavs is the equivalent of a modern Maxim.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.44,0:52:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三代星光观察仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third-generation starlight scopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.74,0:52:54.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是雷射瞄准短筒机关枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A laser-sighting short-barreled machine pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.68,0:52:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,步兵部队迷你导弹 射程五公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Infantrv mini-missiles. Range: five kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.18,0:53:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒 按一下就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And smart. Just fire and forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.35,0:53:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它无坚不摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It penetrates all existing armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.22,0:53:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你订货的样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, samples of everything ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.62,0:53:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订单已经取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The order is canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.46,0:53:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四十八小时内 你得退回五千万元订金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll return our deposit of $50 million within the next 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.56,0:53:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是认真的 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be serious, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.66,0:53:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道得到这些武器有多困难?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how hard it is to obtain this equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.47,0:53:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是美国与欧洲最新的产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,this is the latest U.S. and European stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.13,0:53:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又借又赊才弄到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made commitments, letters of credit, special payoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.74,0:53:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的钱在你的瑞士银行户口 已经八个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know that you've had our monev in your Swiss account for 8 weeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.31,0:53:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但是你从没付过任何款项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that you have made no payments of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.08,0:53:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在取消订单已经太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't cancel orders at this late date.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.71,0:53:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为一个老兵 要守诺言...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As one old soldier to another, you have my word we will deliver...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.12,0:53:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别对我摆出军人的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare me your militarv pretensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.49,0:53:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪个军队服役?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What army did you serve in?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.12,0:53:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你因诈骗而被西点赶出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were expelled from west Point for cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.76,0:53:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后在比利时属刚果 当短期的雇佣兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then a short stint as a mercenarv in the Belgian Congo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.26,0:53:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来你在支持你做军火卖买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later you worked with various criminal organizations...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.77,0:53:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...的不同的犯罪集团混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that financed your first arms deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.10,0:53:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的对手发放的谣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lies spread by my competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.87,0:54:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像忘了很多 我曾经过科斯克夫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to forget your many so-called wars of liberation...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.31,0:54:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...提供武器给你进行 你所谓的解放战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I have supplied through General Koskov.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.41,0:54:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的商业信誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are my business credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.34,0:54:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你两天之内给我钱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The monev in two davs...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.55,0:54:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...否则你永远别想干这行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or you will find yourself out of business permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.68,0:54:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基奥治也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Georgi Koskov as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.12,0:54:15.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你们俩在搞什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you two are scheming...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.16,0:54:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但是够了 明白了没有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it is over. Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.70,0:54:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.38,0:54:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计程车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.32,0:54:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像基奥治所说 维也纳好美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vienna's beautiful, just like Georgi said.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.46,0:54:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很关心他 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You care for him a great deal, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.69,0:54:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠他的太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.53,0:54:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在公立音乐学院的奖学金 我的斯特拉提琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My scholarship at the conservatoire, my Strad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.66,0:55:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的大提琴是斯特拉的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cello's a Stradivarius?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.70,0:55:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有名的 叫做玫瑰夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A famous one. The Ladv Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.64,0:55:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 基奥治在纽约买的 - 不错的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Georgi got it in New York. - Quite a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.87,0:55:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许有天我会在卡内基演奏厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe somedav I'll play there at Carnegie Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.68,0:55:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 基奥治认为我可以的 - 他说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Georgi believes I can do it. - I'm sure he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.62,0:55:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们现在去找他? - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We go to him now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.85,0:55:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非他已走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless he had to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.52,0:55:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若他真的走了 他定会留个讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he did, I'm sure he left a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.96,0:56:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danke.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.40,0:56:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.80,0:56:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.91,0:56:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午安 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.98,0:56:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你住平时那间套房吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will need your usual suite?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.88,0:56:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 汉斯 要两个相连的套房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not tonight, Hans. Something with a second bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.99,0:56:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要送伏特加马丁尼来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I have the vodka martinis sent up?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.85,0:56:34.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要摇的 不要搅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.75,0:56:36.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.60,0:56:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际出口部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.00,0:56:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是邦德 我要两张歌剧门票 左边厢房的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond here. I need two tickets for the opera left at the box office.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.48,0:57:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:06.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给公主的还是政委夫人的?  - 买吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For princess or wife of commissar? - Let's buv it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.99,0:57:09.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开玩笑 谁付钱呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't joke. who will pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.72,0:57:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是基奥治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Georgi, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.61,0:57:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Stop it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.01,0:57:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chief wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.46,0:57:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得去报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.88,0:58:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 稍息 军士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verv good. At ease, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.75,0:58:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金想要回钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pushkin wants the monev back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.85,0:58:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worrv.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.82,0:58:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说服了英方 普谢金是个危险人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've convinced the British that Pushkin is a danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会派最好的特务詹姆斯邦德 去铲除他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will send their best man, James Bond,to eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.76,0:58:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不相信 尼高斯也做得到吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not convinced. Necros can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.56,0:58:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经跟俄罗斯人合作 他们知道我的底细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've worked with the Russians. They know my appearance and methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.63,0:58:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会危害跟我有关的革命同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It mav jeopardize my comrades working for revolution who depend on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.14,0:58:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们依赖我 除了我还有谁可以提供军备呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they depend upon me. where else will they find a supply of arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.74,0:58:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们本来的计划很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our basic plan is sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.94,0:58:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金…该怎么说呢? 玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pushkin is.... How you say? Historv.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.04,0:58:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不是 你们的邦德还没动他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not vet. Your James Bond hasn't laid a finger on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.85,0:58:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国人天生多疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The British are naturally cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.35,0:58:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再刺激一下他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An additional inducement will ensure this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.45,0:58:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说 若另一个特务被杀了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For instance, if another agent were eliminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:59:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干吧 若普谢金有命参加会议 就杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it. But if Pushkin is still alive during the conference, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.48,0:59:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我梦寐以求的事情 - 也许有一天你会在这里表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All my life, I've dreamed of this. - Maybe you'll play here one dav.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.58,1:00:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那太遥不可及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too much to hope for.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.69,1:00:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要离开一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me for a few moments.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.43,1:00:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这不就是...  - 大提琴的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that the... - The cello girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.23,1:00:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是KGB狙击手 干嘛带她到这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The KGB sniper. why bring her here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.20,1:00:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是KGB狙击手 她是科斯克夫的女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not a KGB sniper. She's Koskov's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.71,1:00:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她负责向他发空弹 让他的逃亡看来是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was supposed to shoot blanks at him to make his defection look real to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.91,1:00:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他伪装逃亡?  听说KGB把他抓回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koskov's defection phonv? I heard the KGB snatched him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.08,1:00:29.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是我们以为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we were supposed to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.05,1:00:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是严重的控罪 你现在在做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are serious accusations, Bond. What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.85,1:00:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我假装是科斯克夫的朋友 看看从她身上可以打听到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm posing as Koskov's friend just to see what leads I can get from her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.06,1:00:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他在纽约给她买了 叫玫瑰夫人的大提琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know he bought her a cello in New York, called The Ladv Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.20,1:00:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大提琴有名字吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cello with a name?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.13,1:00:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是斯拉特系列的 全部都有名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Stradivarius. They all have names.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.67,1:00:54.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去调查科斯克夫 从哪里来这么多的钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,where would Koskov get that kind of monev? Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.74,1:00:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我今晚要给她预备身分文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll need papers for her tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.24,1:00:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我就要把她送离这国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get her out of the countrv by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.24,1:01:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 今天下午照的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Took these this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.71,1:01:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 这不合规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,this is highly irregular.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.62,1:01:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我起码要一天才能得到伦敦批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be able to get the okay from London for a dav at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.75,1:01:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能再等了   桑德斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't wait, Saunders.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.16,1:01:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这女的是我们找到 科斯克夫的唯一希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl's our only chance of getting Koskov back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.76,1:01:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 除了退休金以外 我没什么损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verv well. I've got nothing to lose but my pension.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.50,1:01:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚在柏拉达咖啡店等我 在摩天轮附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet me at the Prater Cafe, near the Ferris wheel, at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.70,1:02:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 够了 - 这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No more. - This one.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.59,1:02:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我上摩天轮去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.11,1:02:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以看得清楚一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be able to see better.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.75,1:02:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要汽球吗?  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Balloon,mein Herr? - Nein.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.29,1:03:02.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是现实还是梦境?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it real or just a dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.08,1:03:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了? 干嘛停下来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong? why did we stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.32,1:03:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我安排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I arranged it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以整个晚上都留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could be here all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.36,1:03:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.40,1:03:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只认识你两天 我都在想 我们怎样可以在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowing you only 2 davs, and all I can think of is how we would be together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.91,1:03:53.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想了 就让它发生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think. Just let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.01,1:04:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想再玩一次吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want another ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.73,1:04:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.43,1:04:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有人给我留讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There mav be a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.82,1:05:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他最近在纽约的拍卖会买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was bought recently at auction in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.52,1:05:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,124号 玫瑰夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Lot 124. The Ladv Rose.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.79,1:05:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1724年克雷莫纳 斯特拉大提琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cello by Stradivarius of Cremona, 1724.''
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.16,1:05:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以十五万元...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sold for $150,000...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.33,1:05:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...卖给布拉德惠特克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to Brad whitaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.27,1:05:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠特克? 那军火商?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitaker? The arms dealer?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.87,1:05:30.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.84,1:05:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是科斯克夫和惠特克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koskov and whitaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.21,1:05:37.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠特克现在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's whitaker now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.75,1:05:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在丹吉尔他家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At his place in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.35,1:05:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.92,1:05:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.25,1:05:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桑德斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saunders.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.52,1:05:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.23,1:06:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.08,1:06:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.02,1:06:55.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有基奥治的消息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear from Georgi?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.59,1:07:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.36,1:07:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.43,1:07:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟惠特克在丹吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's with whitaker in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.40,1:07:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布拉德惠特克? 那美国人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad whitaker? The American?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.47,1:07:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你认识他 - 他是个艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know him. - He's a patron of the arts.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.97,1:07:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基奥治说他会帮我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Georgi said he'd help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.28,1:07:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们多快可以启程?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How soon do we have to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.51,1:07:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应基奥治尽快送你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised Georgi I'd get you back as soon as I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.05,1:07:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能多留几天吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't we stav here a few davs?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.25,1:07:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 明天早上就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. we leave first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.80,1:09:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.50,1:09:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.10,1:09:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别乱动 上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make any sudden moves, general.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.60,1:09:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走向桌子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.38,1:10:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.52,1:10:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.76,1:10:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你不是来联谊的 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it that this is not a social call, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.13,1:10:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 你该带百合花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct. You should have brought lilies.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.90,1:10:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.60,1:10:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诛杀特务行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smiert Spionom.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.11,1:10:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诛杀特务行动...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smiert Spionom...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.91,1:10:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...那是斯达林时代的贝利亚行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was a Beria operation in Stalin's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.78,1:10:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十年前已经废除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was deactivated 20 vears ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.45,1:10:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们死了两个特务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of our agents are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.25,1:10:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节哀顺变 我们跟这件事无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My condolences. we had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.45,1:11:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科斯克夫在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Koskov?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.32,1:11:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他两星期前失踪前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He disappeared two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.15,1:11:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 本来我要捉他 - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was about to have him arrested. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.09,1:11:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他浪费国家经费 - 惠特克有参与吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For misusing state funds. - Involying whitaker?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.02,1:11:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是机密问题 不能跟你讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a securitv matter and cannot be discussed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.43,1:11:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真笨!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was damn stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.45,1:11:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲在浴室把门锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the bathroom and lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.66,1:11:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stav where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.00,1:11:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.90,1:12:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手放在脑后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.31,1:12:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是专业的 不会在没有原因下杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are professional. You do not kill without reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.28,1:12:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个人死了 科斯克夫说是你干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of our men are dead. Koskov's named you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.18,1:12:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我干嘛达抗命令?  - 我跟你一样不知情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now,why should I disobev my orders? - I am in the dark as much as you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.29,1:12:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是信任问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a question of trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.72,1:12:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信谁呢? 科斯克夫还是我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you believe? Koskov or me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.89,1:12:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我相信科斯克夫 就不会在这里跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I trusted Koskov, we wouldn't be talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.93,1:12:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as long as you're alive...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.37,1:12:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道他会怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we'll never know what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.44,1:12:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我一定要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.31,1:12:43.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位来宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.81,1:12:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很荣幸介绍俄罗斯代表主席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it is indeed my honor to introduce the head of the Russian delegation...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.62,1:12:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利昂尼普谢金同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Comrade Leonid Pushkin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.23,1:13:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honored delegates...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.13,1:13:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我代表苏维埃共和国的同志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I bring you profound fraternal greetings...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.24,1:13:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向你们致以友好的问候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from your comrades in Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.88,1:13:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到上面!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.69,1:13:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要! …\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.63,1:13:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,封锁这大楼! 一个人都不能离去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the building! Let no one out!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.14,1:14:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要! 利昂尼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Leonid!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.35,1:15:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去玩吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You looking for a partv?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.15,1:15:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是个不错的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.76,1:15:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉要你受那么多苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to put you through that, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.36,1:15:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我第一次 因为詹姆斯邦德是个好射手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the first time I've ever been grateful...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.97,1:15:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而感到庆幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that James Bond is a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.67,1:15:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来吧 下次再玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over here. we can have a partv some other time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.94,1:15:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的小礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little present for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.37,1:15:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不够吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.07,1:15:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.11,1:15:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好的享受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just sit back and enjov the ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.50,1:16:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到下面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down below.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.44,1:16:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟想搞什么鬼 007?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you trving to do, 007?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.77,1:16:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引发第三次世界大战吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start world war III?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.77,1:16:23.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲利斯利达 好了 中央情报局在这干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felix Leiter. Now, what's the CIA doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.28,1:16:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.11,1:16:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会觉得不开心?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No hard feelings?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.58,1:16:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要派对继续就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if the party's still on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.25,1:16:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这故事很长 但最后普谢金奇迹地康复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story, but in the end, Pushkin makes a miraculous recovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.46,1:16:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是虚张声势?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean this is a put-up job?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.56,1:16:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.29,1:16:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从几天前他跟惠特克见面 我们就开始监视普谢金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been watching Pushkin since he met a couple of davs ago with whitaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.76,1:16:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 和俄罗斯的非法军火买卖?  - 你问倒我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Illegal arms deal with the Russians? - Well,you've got me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.60,1:16:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠特克 带了几个高科技东西样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitaker's put together a few samples of high-tech stuff...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.30,1:16:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但现在还没做成大买卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he's placed no big orders vet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.64,1:16:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们似乎以不同的方向 干同一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we've been working on the same case from opposite ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.47,1:17:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们好好谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk shop.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.91,1:17:04.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.58,1:17:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你 我们在收音机听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. we heard it over the radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.51,1:17:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没杀他 是邦德干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't kill him. Bond did.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.12,1:17:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经告诉你英国人相信我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you the British believed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.89,1:17:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you! I told you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.19,1:17:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在可以走了 我会通知阿姆斯特丹把钻石运来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we can move. I'll signal Amsterdam to ship the diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.36,1:17:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.72,1:17:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.66,1:17:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.30,1:17:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.77,1:17:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.86,1:18:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪里了 詹姆斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been,James?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.93,1:18:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去了那么久 我好担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were gone so long, I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.79,1:18:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人想念的感觉很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's always nice to be missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.59,1:18:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是找不到基奥治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no sign of Georgi.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 请继续 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, please. Go on playing. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.87,1:18:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝点东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.18,1:18:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remembered.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.38,1:18:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.72,1:18:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nazdravi.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.42,1:18:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些酒调得好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I get it right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.36,1:18:46.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.96,1:18:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.43,1:18:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉 是时候把真相告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kara, it's time I told you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.87,1:19:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是基奥治的朋友 我是寻找他的英国特务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a friend of Georgi's. I'm a British agent looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.41,1:19:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他背叛了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's betraved us all, Kara.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.34,1:19:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄罗斯人 英国人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Russians,the British...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.91,1:19:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...甚至是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.38,1:19:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他告诉我们狙击手要杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told us a sniper might try to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.85,1:19:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后他令你成为狙击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he set you up as the sniper, Kara.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.39,1:19:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要你死因为你知道得太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants you dead. You knew too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.92,1:19:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骗子! 你假装爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liar! You pretended to love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.86,1:19:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打电话找惠特克 基奥治在他那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I telephoned whitaker. Georgi was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.29,1:19:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把真相告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.26,1:19:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这KGB特务利用我来找他 然后杀死他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a KGB agent using me to find him and kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.63,1:19:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,that's not...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.77,1:19:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是真的 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.30,1:20:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kara, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.07,1:20:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were absolutely perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.51,1:20:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.82,1:20:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 请下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sortez, s'il yous plait.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.74,1:21:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,移植用的人类器官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merci, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.94,1:21:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.38,1:21:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 必须绝对卫生无菌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful. It must be kept absolutely sterile.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.32,1:21:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.06,1:22:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都被骗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.83,1:22:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both have.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.40,1:22:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把盖子打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the lid.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.74,1:22:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.00,1:22:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是人的器官 这是动物的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not human. It's an animal's heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.04,1:22:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钻石藏在冰里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diamonds hidden in the ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.08,1:22:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我怎样可以帮你?  - 找我的钥匙圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can I help you? - I need my kev ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.12,1:22:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.51,1:23:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给客人一杯黑咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black coffee for our guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.78,1:23:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has so many talents.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.61,1:23:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.68,1:23:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛不杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.52,1:23:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a barbarian,James.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.15,1:23:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你去苏维埃有关当局...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking you to the proper Soviet authorities...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.05,1:23:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...说你杀了普谢金上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for the killing of General Pushkin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.42,1:23:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真厉害 你让我为你杀了普谢金...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a wonder, Georgi. You get me to kill Pushkin for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.59,1:23:39.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...然后把我交给俄罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then you turn me in to the Russians for his murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.76,1:23:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要求什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to ask for?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.60,1:23:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豁免权?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immunity?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.60,1:23:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,移民西方和享受新生活?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to emigrate and enjoy the amenities of the west?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.50,1:23:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会原谅你的变节吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't honestly think they'll condone your defection, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.61,1:23:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么变节?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What defection?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.64,1:23:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为普谢金进行秘密任务...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been on a secret mission for General Pushkin...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.81,1:23:59.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...就是给英方情报机关提供假情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to disinform British Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.51,1:24:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry,James.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.05,1:24:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的很喜欢你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you I have great affection...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.88,1:24:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但我们有个古老说法:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we have an old saying:
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.15,1:24:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"完成任务不可以感情用事"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Duty has no sweethearts.''
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.09,1:24:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也有个老说法 基奥治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an old saying too, Georgi.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.66,1:24:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"你真是混蛋"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''You're full of it.''
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.71,1:24:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Kara.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.22,1:24:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡拉?  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kara? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.23,1:25:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到阿富汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.83,1:25:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费耶达上校 我的老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Fevador, my old comrade in arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.06,1:25:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是行刺普谢金上将的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have here General Pushkin's assassin...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.73,1:25:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国特务007 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...British agent 007,James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.40,1:25:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确定把他送到莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See he is sent to Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.57,1:25:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 还有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One moment. There is one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.07,1:25:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她也带走吧 她是个背叛者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her too. She's a defector.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.57,1:25:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很同情你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be compassionate with you...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.81,1:25:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且会试试安排你去 西伯利亚管弦乐团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and trv to have you assigned to the Siberian Philharmonic Orchestra.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.01,1:25:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不错的 虽然他们的演奏技巧平庸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're quite good, despite their bourgeois repertoire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.53,1:25:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在执行国家秘密任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am on a secret state mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.96,1:25:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要几队人和货车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a detachment of men and some trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.30,1:25:57.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们为什么而来呢?  - 谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are these here for? - For murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.44,1:26:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谋杀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murder!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.51,1:26:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久没有女囚犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't had a woman prisoner for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.35,1:26:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.08,1:26:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲁斯基 费耶达上校考虑了我的上诉没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rusky, has Colonel Fevador considered my appeal?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.25,1:26:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的! 有好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.19,1:26:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明早不会被问吊 你会被枪射死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be hung in the morning. You will be shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.36,1:26:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你弄错了! 我什么都没偷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all a mistake! I stole nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.00,1:26:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到阿拉真神时对他说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell Allah when you see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.20,1:26:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衣服脱光!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strip!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.90,1:26:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大声说你要什么 这里有隔音的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shout all you want. It's soundproof.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.97,1:26:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上校不喜欢听到有人尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The colonel doesn't like to hear screaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.58,1:26:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没叫你蹲下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't tell you to get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.95,1:26:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没叫你站起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not tell you to get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.65,1:26:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.35,1:28:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁上门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.39,1:28:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真厉害 我们自由了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were fantastic. we're free!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.86,1:28:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在阿富汉中央的 俄罗斯空军基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're inside a Russian air base in the middle of Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.36,1:28:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试小的那把钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trv the small key.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.80,1:28:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起码我们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least we're together.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.87,1:28:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrific. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.11,1:28:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.76,1:30:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 跳吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.84,1:30:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 我告诉他们你不是俄罗斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - I tell them you no Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.24,1:30:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们现在不会杀你 - 现在不会? 那晚点呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They no kill you now. - Not now? How about later?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.91,1:30:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 他们会为你的美色救你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. They'll saye you for the harem.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.99,1:31:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是穆加哈顿游击队的杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the work of the Mujahideen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.43,1:31:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穆加哈顿游击队?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mujahideen?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.20,1:31:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿富汉的反抗者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Afghan resistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.38,1:33:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望没有请他吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope he's not invited to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.50,1:33:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们俩的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you both for your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.24,1:33:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫甘兰沙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Kamran Shah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.70,1:33:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要介意我的差劲演技 是我在牛津时学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please forgive the theatricals. It's a hangover from my Oxford davs.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.61,1:33:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信你要换衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you'd like to freshen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.48,1:33:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.95,1:33:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得回空军基地去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get back to the air base.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.22,1:33:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了! 俄罗斯军队在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're crazy! Russian army's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.73,1:33:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不帮我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't help?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.60,1:34:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.26,1:34:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那起码你带我去找 穆加哈顿游击队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then at least put me in touch with the Mujahideen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.94,1:34:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东部的副指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deputy commander of the Eastern District.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.60,1:34:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在空军基地侦察时被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was caught reconnoitering the air base.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.64,1:34:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很幸运 但他们不知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankfully for me, they didn't know who I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.11,1:34:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.18,1:34:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为英国政府工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for the British government.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.52,1:34:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们揭发了俄罗斯科斯克夫上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've uncovered a plot by a Russian General Koskov...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.22,1:34:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...跟美国购买高科技武器的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to purchase American high-tech weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.35,1:34:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用来对付你和你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arms that could be used against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.42,1:34:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可跟我有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is important.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.73,1:34:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接到凯巴关口找我们的指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go directly to our commander in the Khvber Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.59,1:34:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要好几天 我得在科斯克夫离开前赶到基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could take days. I have to get to the air base before Koskov leaves.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.73,1:34:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天跟我们一起去 任务完成以后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, come with us tomorrow and after our mission...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.00,1:34:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看看我可以做什么 - 那太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I'll see what I can do. - That'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.57,1:34:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要手枪和带路的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a gun and some guides.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.21,1:34:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 我们没有多余的人或马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible. I cannot spare men or the horses.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.21,1:35:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it is time to rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.28,1:35:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日出的时候出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We leave at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.29,1:35:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was worried for you,James.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.16,1:35:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going to happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.43,1:35:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.41,1:35:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿富汉语"漂亮"的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means ''beautiful'' in Afghan.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.34,1:35:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在穆加哈顿游击队地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're with the Mujahideen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.45,1:35:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我们和他们走 执行些任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We leave with them tomorrow on some kind of operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.25,1:35:52.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你则去凯巴关口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're going to the Khvber Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.02,1:35:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不跟我一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.02,1:35:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我晚点才跟着去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.46,1:36:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是要回去找基奥治吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going back for Georgi, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.56,1:36:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太危险了 别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dangerous, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.50,1:36:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得去 - 去干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have to. - You have to what?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.13,1:36:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找死吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.13,1:36:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.67,1:36:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好 我叫甘兰直接送你回伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. Then I'll have Kamran send you direct to London.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.14,1:36:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这顽固的死笨...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dumb, stubborn, stupid...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.78,1:36:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.78,1:36:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这死鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back end of horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.75,1:36:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我做死鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you calling me a horse's ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.69,1:36:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能不会再见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.43,1:36:53.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.50,1:36:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.89,1:38:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生的鸦片 纽约市值五亿元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raw opium. worth half a billion dollars on the streets of New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.30,1:39:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在干嘛? 卖鸦片吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you up to, selling dope?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.61,1:39:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小声点 那是雪豹集团的老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so loud. That's the chief of the Snow Leopard Brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.84,1:39:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是黄金月形地带最大的鸦片批发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The biggest opium dealer in the Golden Crescent.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.61,1:39:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有时也跟他们做买卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for them sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.21,1:39:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管俄罗斯人因我的子弹 还是他们的鸦片而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't care if the Russians die from my bullets or their opium.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.82,1:39:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 我们要钱买军火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides,we need the monev to buy arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.95,1:39:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基奥治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Georgi.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.45,1:39:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.49,1:39:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他安排俄罗斯人买高科技武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He arranged for the Russians to buv high-tech weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.96,1:39:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他用那些钱买鸦片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's using that monev to buy opium.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.30,1:39:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几天就可以赚大钱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can turn a huge profit in days...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.86,1:39:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...同时也可以给俄罗斯提供军火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and still provide the Russians with their arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.73,1:39:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 除非... - 继续说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unless.... - Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.27,1:39:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果鸦片永远到不了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the opium never arrives?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.31,1:39:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪豹集团不是容易对付的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Brotherhood are very dangerous to cross.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.41,1:39:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 俄罗斯入侵以来最大的交易 - 你不打算帮忙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Biggest deal since Russian invasion. - You won't help?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.78,1:39:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.58,1:39:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交易不会完成 除非俄国人付清费用后离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If nothing is done till the Russians pay up and leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.62,1:40:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我要一些塑胶炸药和计时器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. I'll need some plastic explosives and a timer.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.82,1:40:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我可以做些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.04,1:40:31.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停住!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.65,1:40:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.53,1:41:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯被抓住了 我们得救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James is trapped. You must help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.50,1:41:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要承受风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got to take his chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.07,1:41:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你欠他你的命 - 我无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You owe him your life. - There's nothing more I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.74,1:41:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.65,1:42:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.42,1:43:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费耶达上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Fevador.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.84,1:44:04.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里等一下 我们会回来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here. we'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.67,1:45:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪! 别炸毁飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot! Don't destroy the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.76,1:47:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 挡住跑道!  - 是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Block the runway! - Da!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.61,1:48:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那架运油车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tanker!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.94,1:49:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.88,1:49:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得制止他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.18,1:49:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kara.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.29,1:50:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪! 你会击中飞机!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot! You'll hit the plane!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.99,1:51:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡拉!  - 我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kara! - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.23,1:51:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.99,1:51:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来了 接手吧 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now that you're here,take over. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.83,1:52:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧 保持平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold this straight and level.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.03,1:52:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你去哪里?  - 拆掉炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - To defuse a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.55,1:55:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.49,1:55:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.08,1:56:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 他拿了我的靴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - He got the boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.83,1:57:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接手 这次保持平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take over. Hold it steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.73,1:57:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你去哪里?  - 投炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - To drop a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.36,1:58:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.56,1:58:54.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燃料就快完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing fuel fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.40,1:59:07.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望可以熬到巴基斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just hope we can make Pakistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.62,1:59:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有地方可以着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no place to put down.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.53,1:59:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去 上车 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go in the back. Get in the jeep. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.98,1:59:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系紧安全带!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fasten your seat belt!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.59,2:00:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.34,2:00:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道卡拉奇最好的餐馆在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a great restaurant in Karachi.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.34,2:00:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以在那里吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can just make dinner.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.55,2:00:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠特克在地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitaker's on the groundfloor.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.49,2:00:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科斯克夫在楼上一个房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Koskov is in one of theupstairs bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.99,2:00:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你旁边的池边有个守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard in the pool area near you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.23,2:00:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,守卫离开 继续行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard clear. Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.87,2:01:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holdit.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.94,2:01:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.94,2:01:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 詹姆斯 通话完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go,James. Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.94,2:01:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's in.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.73,2:01:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮克特的任务该在墓地山脉完成 而不是在小圆山顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pickett's charge was up Cemetery Ridge, not Little Round Top.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.84,2:01:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在重演先前的战事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm replaying the battle as I would have fought it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.47,2:01:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米德虽然顽强 但他也很小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meade was tenacious, but he was cautious.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.07,2:01:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他错过了 在盖第斯堡撞死阿李的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He missed his chances to crush Lee at Gettvsburg.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.01,2:02:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来找科斯克夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come for Koskov.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.45,2:02:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我拿到鸦片...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hell,you can have him...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.72,2:02:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你马上可以带他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as soon as I get my opium.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.35,2:02:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在鸦片在哪里?  - 化为乌有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now,where is it? - Up in smoke.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.35,2:02:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你烧毁了五亿元?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You burned up a half a billion bucks?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.46,2:02:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德 那真糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,that's too bad, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.79,2:02:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你本来可以做一个富有的活人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,you could have been a live rich man...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.53,2:02:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...而不是一个死了的穷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...instead of a poor dead one.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.73,2:02:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完蛋了 惠特克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're finished,whitaker.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.10,2:02:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若俄罗斯不抓你 美国人也会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Russians don't get you, the Americans will.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.97,2:02:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.30,2:02:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 米德本来会多害 三万五千个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Meade should have taken another 35,000 casualties.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.34,2:02:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样最后会发生暴动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could have ended the rebellion right there.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.71,2:02:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格兰会摆平它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grant would have done it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.43,2:03:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已开了八枪 现在到我的八十枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've had your eight. Now I'll have my 80.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.81,2:03:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 你的玩具枪 比不过我最先进的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to say,your popgun is no match for the latest body armor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.10,2:03:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早知道你会躲在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should have known you'd take refuge...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.40,2:03:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...英国威灵顿贪心汉背后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...behind that British vulture wellington.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.38,2:04:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他买了德国雇佣兵...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know he had to buv German mercenaries...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.78,2:04:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...来对付拿破伦的 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to beat Napoleon, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.90,2:04:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠你的 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owed you that one, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.10,2:04:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他战败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He met his waterloo.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.14,2:04:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普谢金上将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Pushkin.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.11,2:04:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着 真好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.12,2:04:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠特克抓住我几个星期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whitaker has held me here for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.22,2:04:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我 谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for rescuing me. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.59,2:05:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他乘下一班到莫斯科的航机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him on the next plane to Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.69,2:05:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 上将! 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, general! Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.60,2:05:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放在外交邮袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the diplomatic bag.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.51,2:05:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那卡拉呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Kara?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.48,2:05:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也是背叛者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is a defector too.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.94,2:05:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么处里她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What shall we do about her?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.99,2:06:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要留在法国吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to stav in France now?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.23,2:06:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来吧 介意我们离开一会吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me, my dear. will you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.27,2:06:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高戈上将 这是卡拉米劳维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Gogol, Miss Kara Milovy.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.27,2:06:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常精彩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.31,2:06:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你很快可以来莫斯科表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you can find time to play in Moscow very soon.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.01,2:06:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 高戈上将现在在外交部工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. General Gogol's now with their foreign service.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.52,2:06:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会安排移民签证...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's arranged an immigration visa...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.88,2:06:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...让你可以随时出入境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so you can come and go as you like.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.29,2:07:01.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.32,2:07:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.86,2:07:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.99,2:07:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我们错过了音乐会 我们在机厂出了点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry we missed the concert. we had some trouble at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.06,2:07:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想也想不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.93,2:07:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高戈上将 你见过甘兰沙没有?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Gogol, have you met Kamran Shah?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.97,2:07:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 詹姆斯在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My pleasure. - Where's James?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.80,2:07:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜 他有任务到外国去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unhappily, he's on assignment abroad.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.20,2:07:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很快就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be with you shortly.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.60,2:07:59.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我真的错过了音乐会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't think I'd miss this performance, did you?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.84,2:08:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,James.
